Z||000000||RiceBurner515||11-05-2000||11:30 PM||||Does anybody have 6x9's in boxes in their Fiero? If so......where abouts? I was thinking about on the passenger floor and one behind the pass. seat above my 10" sub box. any sugg. i don't want to cut anything or take out anything factory.||||reg||1
Z||000001||SibERThuG||11-06-2000||01:46 AM||||I put a 6x9 in a box way up in the passenger foot well. I hooked an amp up to it too. It fits in there deep if you play with it. However, If you have a sub behind the seat it won't leave much passenger foot room (if you care). You can also put the 6x9's in the dash where the 4x10's go with very minimal cutting and you can still use the speaker covers (you CAN'T tell you cut it!) So, hope this helps. <P>------------------<BR>Robbie<BR>88' Formula||||reg||10
